ion of two or more species.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nNatural essential oil sanitary insect pest repellent and its use (https://www.freepatentsonline.com/y2006/0257441.html)\nciteturn44search3 [wordlim: 200] Published: 20.0 years ago; Crawled: 3 weeks ago; Specific examples of the acrylic acid polymer are Junlon series (PW-110 and PW-150 produced by Nihon Junyaku Co., Ltd.), and Carbopole series (907 and 910 produced by Showa Denko Co., Ltd.)\n# BEST MODE FOR CARRYING OUT THE INVENTION\n\nThe repellent active compound of the invention can be applied to the following sanitary insect pests which hold on our foods and grains to spread infectious diseases, to eat away foods and to cause pains or disease in human bodies; such as cockroaches, flies, hypothesiums, deathwatches, indian meal moth, sawtoothed grain beetle, maize weevils, termites, beetles (grain weevils, red flour beetles and museum beetles), scale bugs, moths (clothes moths, and tineola bisselliella) and the like.\n\nThe acrylic acid polymer to be used as a dispersion stabilizer for the dispersion of particles, alias, polyacrylic acid, is prepared by polymerizing two or more kinds of acrylic acids. Especially a crosslinking type acrylic acid polymer can be used. Specific examples of the acrylic acid polymer are Junlon series (PW-110 and PW-150 produced by Nihon Junyaku Co., Ltd.), and Carbopole series (907 and 910 produced by Showa Denko Co., Ltd.) (Japanese Unexamined Patent Publication No. Hei 9-77605). --------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nCENS培养基CENS medium ATCC Medium 1926 培养基购买价格、配方、配制方法、用途、全称等基本信息_生物风培养基 (https://www.biofeng.com/shiji/peiyangji/M3445.html)\nciteturn44search4 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 5 months ago; ## CENS medium ATCC Medium 1926 培养基产品基本信息 ... NaVO3 . nH2O (meta) ..........5.0 mg\n\n# CENS培养基\n\n580 850 0 0 0\n\n价格：元\n\n规格： 250g 500g 0 0 0\n\n联系方式：I47-825O-882O\n\n[Input] [Input] [I